			"Message": "refactor(Worker): Expand ESBuild configuration files to readable format\n\nReverts the minification from the previous commit, expanding Configuration/ESBuild/Target.js and Worker.js from compressed single-line format back to human-readable code with descriptive variable names.\n\nChanges include:\n- Replacing single-letter variables (e, r, n, a, i, t, o, s, On, Clean, Worker_default) with full names\n- Adding proper indentation, line breaks, and structural formatting\n- Including source map references (sourceMappingURL)\n- Preserving all original functionality while improving maintainability\n\nThe configuration files are now easier to read, debug, and modify during development of the Worker element's build pipeline.",
